{"id":35,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"It can be found in quiet mountain areas on a full moon's night. Its dancing and its tiny, faintly glowing wings confer upon it a lovely fairylike quality."},{"games":["Shield","SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"Its adorable behavior and cry make it highly popular. However, this cute Pokémon is rarely found."},{"games":["Sword","X","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It is said that happiness will come to those who see a gathering of Clefairy dancing under a full moon."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"Adored for their cute looks and playfulness. They are thought to be rare, as they do not appear often."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Bathed in moonlight, its wings glow faintly. Without even flapping, Clefairy rises into the air, where it dances around."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"They’re popular, but they’re rare. Trainers who show them off recklessly may be targeted by thieves."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"On nights with a full moon, they gather together and dance. The surrounding area is enveloped in an abnormal magnetic field."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Its adorable behavior and appearance make it popular with men and women, young and old. Its numbers are few, however."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"On every night of a full moon, groups of this Pokémon come out to play. When dawn arrives, the tired Clefairy return to their quiet mountain retreats and go to sleep nestled up against each other."},{"games":["Y","HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"The moonlight that it stores in the wings on its back apparently gives it the ability to float in midair."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"On nights with a full moon, Clefairy gather from all over and dance. Bathing in moonlight makes them float."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"It flies using the wings on its back to collect moonlight. This Pokémon is difficult to find."},{"games":["Diamond"],"text":"Thought to live with others on quiet mountains, it is popular for its adorable nature."},{"games":["LeafGreen"],"text":"With its magical and cute appeal, it has many admirers. It is rare and found only in certain areas."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"Its adorable appearance makes it popular as a pet. However, it is rare and difficult to find."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"On every night of a full moon, they come out to play. When dawn arrives, the tired CLEFAIRY go to sleep nestled up against each other in deep and quiet mountains."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"Though rarely seen, it becomes easier to spot, for some reason, on the night of a full moon."},{"games":["Blue","Red"],"text":"Its magical and cute appeal has many admirers. It is rare and found only in certain areas."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Cute Charm","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon may infatuate attackers that make direct contact with it."},{"name":"Magic Guard","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon only takes damage from attacks."},{"name":"Friend Guard","hidden":true,"description":"Reduces damage dealt to allies."}],"eggGroups":["Fairy"],"genderRate":6,"hatchCounter":10,"baseHappiness":140,"growthRate":"fast","habitat":"mountain","color":"Pink","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":173,"name":"Cleffa","condition":null,"children":[{"id":35,"name":"Clefairy","condition":"Level up, High Friendship","children":[{"id":36,"name":"Clefable","condition":"Use Moon Stone","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,1],[1,45],[1,47],[1,111],[1,150],[1,186],[1,204],[1,383],[1,574],[4,500],[8,227],[12,495],[16,791],[20,118],[24,236],[28,356],[32,309],[36,266],[40,322],[44,585],[48,361]],"machine":[914,133,226,59,34,280,347,451,204,886,605,91,574,38,409,577,814,227,283,203,263,313,126,7,53,374,264,447,356,270,304,58,8,196,286,282,113,345,800,118,802,581,101,583,182,60,244,94,473,240,115,156,247,285,214,76,446,500,164,241,129,36,851,168,87,9,86,85,271,253,352,428],"egg":[505,217